error_signature: "fatal error: 'gsmlib/gsm_nls.h' file not found|INCLUDES = -I..|top_srcdir"
root_cause: "autotools 多目录工程（gsmlib/apps/tests/ext）的 Makefile.in 用 INCLUDES = -I..，in-tree 构建可解析自引用头 <lib/xxx.h>；但 Conan/out-of-tree（VPATH）构建时编译目录位于 build-release/<subdir>，-I.. 指向 build 而非源码根，导致 #include <gsmlib/...> 找不到。"
rec_approach: "将相关 Makefile.in 的 INCLUDES 改为 -I.. -I$(top_srcdir)（在生成的 Makefile 中 top_srcdir 指向源码根），使 out-of-tree 构建下 <lib/...> 自引用头可解析。"
match_keywords: ["INCLUDES", "top_srcdir", "VPATH", "out-of-tree", "Makefile.in", "fatal error", "file not found", "autotools", "conan build dir"]
error_excerpt: "clang++ ... -I. -I<build>/gsmlib -I.. -I.. ... -c gsm_phonebook.cc | fatal error: 'gsmlib/gsm_nls.h' file not found"
severity: P1
category: portability
last_updated: 2026-09-27
